```

---

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] `log_event("test", {"x": 1})` creates correct file at correct path
- [ ] Calling it 100 times results in 100 lines, no corruption
- [ ] Two threads calling `log_event` simultaneously never interleave a partial line
- [ ] `get_today_events()` returns parsed list matching what was written
- [ ] A malformed line in the log file does not crash any read function
