    "state":          "working",
    "work_elapsed":   843,
    "work_total":     1500,
    "break_elapsed":  0,
    "break_total":    300,
    "cycle":          2,
    "cycles_total":   4,
    "pomodoro_count": 6,
    "enabled":        True
}
```

This is consumed by the tray tooltip and later by the dashboard API.

